{"speciesId":713,"names":{"fr":"Séracrawl","es":"Avalugg","en":"Avalugg","ja":"クレベース"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Son immense corps recouvert de glace est aussi solide que de l’acier. Quand il se déplace, il écrase tout qui se trouve sur son passage."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Su cuerpo, cubierto de hielo, es tan duro como el propio acero. Su abultada figura le permite arramblar con todo lo que se encuentra a su paso."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Its ice-covered body is as hard as steel. Its cumbersome frame crushes anything that stands in its way."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"凍りついた 体は 鋼鉄のように 硬い。立ちふさがる ものを 巨体で 押しつぶし 移動する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Quand on le voit transportant les petits Grelaçon qui vivent sur son dos, il y a une ressemblance certaine avec les véhicules déplaçant les fusées."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Parece un portaaviones de hielo, por el aspecto que presenta al llevar varios Bergmite en su espalda."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"The way several Bergmite huddle on its back makes it look like an aircraft carrier made of ice."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"背中に 数匹の カチコールを 乗せて 暮らす 様子は まるで 氷の 航空母艦のようだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Son immense corps recouvert de glace est aussi solide que de l’acier. Quand il se déplace, il écrase tout ce qui se trouve sur son passage."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Su cuerpo, cubierto de hielo, es tan duro como el propio acero. Su abultada figura le permite arramblar con todo lo que se encuentra a su paso."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Its ice-covered body is as hard as steel. Its cumbersome frame crushes anything that stands in its way."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"凍りついた 体は 鋼鉄のように 硬い。立ちふさがる ものを 巨体で 押しつぶし 移動する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Quand on le voit transportant les petits Grelaçon qui vivent sur son dos, il y a une ressemblance certaine avec les véhicules déplaçant les fusées."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Parece un portaaviones de hielo, por el aspecto que presenta al llevar varios Bergmite en su espalda."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"The way several Bergmite huddle on its back makes it look like an aircraft carrier made of ice."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"背中に 数匹の カチコールを 乗せて 暮らす 様子は まるで 氷の 航空母艦のようだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il sillonne les eaux glacées des pôles en se mêlant aux icebergs, une foule de Grelaçon collée à son dos."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Surca las aguas de mares gélidos, situados a altas latitudes, llevando a varios Bergmite en el lomo y confundiéndose entre los icebergs."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"At high latitudes, this Pokémon can be found with clusters of Bergmite on its back as it swims among the icebergs."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"何匹もの カチコールを 背中に 乗せて 高緯度の 冷たい 海を 氷山に 紛れて 泳ぐ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Les crevasses sur son dos s’approfondissent au cours de la journée, mais se comblent de nouveau pendant la nuit."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Las fisuras de su cuerpo se agrandan durante el día, pero por la noche vuelven a cerrarse."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"As Avalugg moves about during the day, the cracks in its body deepen. The Pokémon’s body returns to a pristine state overnight."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"日中の 活動で 体の 亀裂は 深くなるが 一晩で 亀裂の ない 体に もどる。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"The armor of ice covering its lower jaw puts steel to shame and can shatter rocks with ease. This Pokémon barrels along steep mountain paths, cleaving through the deep snow."}],"varieties":[{"id":713,"moves":[{"name":"tackle","learns":[[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level